<section class="group">
   <div class="group-head">
      <h2>IPA</h2>
   </div>
   <div class="box ios">
      <p class="note">
         With no IPA selected, the site fetches a decrypted Discord 357.0 IPA from
         dl.redeem.saarland, a third-party mirror Sunbird does not run, and checks it against a
         known SHA-256. Select your own decrypted IPA to patch that one instead. Patching happens in
         your browser with the plugins picked below.
      </p>
      <label class="file-picker">
         <input type="file" id="ipa-file" accept=".ipa,application/octet-stream">
         <span class="file-btn">Select IPA</span>
         <span class="file-label" id="ipa-label">No IPA selected, Discord 357.0 is fetched</span>
      </label>
   </div>
</section>

<style>
.ios {
   display: grid;
   gap: 4px;
   padding: 16px;
}

.note {
   font-size: 13.5px;
   color: var(--muted);
}
</style>

